# Symlink to know-fountains source assets — local convenience, not committed
/raw

# Machine-local shared agent memory (symlinked from ~/.claude/projects/.../memory).
# Default: ignore everything. Exception: track the engineering-manager's durable SEED
# memory (charter + standards) so a fresh clone gets a working EM. Living state
# (arsenal-state, sprint-log), Tim's personal auto-memory, and Codex learnings stay local.
.agent-memory/*
!.agent-memory/engineering-manager/
.agent-memory/engineering-manager/*
!.agent-memory/engineering-manager/charter.md
!.agent-memory/engineering-manager/standards.md
!.agent-memory/engineering-manager/test-plan.md
# storyboard-critic: standing standards + per-project loop reviews travel with the
# committed agent (mirrors engineering-manager). Other agent-memory stays local.
!.agent-memory/storyboard-critic/
.agent-memory/storyboard-critic/*
!.agent-memory/storyboard-critic/standards.md
!.agent-memory/storyboard-critic/reviews/
